# 行尾纪律
#
# 背景：仓库曾把 core.autocrlf 设为 true，导致暂存区内容可能是 CRLF。
# 对 source 文件无害，但对 **shell 脚本是致命的** ——
#   sh 脚本首行 `#!/bin/sh\r` 会报 "bad interpreter: No such file or directory"
#   pre-push hook 在 Linux/macOS 上直接失效，等于门禁形同虚设。
#
# 所以这里显式钉死：脚本一律 LF，跨平台检出也不转换。

# shell 脚本：必须 LF
*.sh            text eol=lf
.githooks/*     text eol=lf
*.bash          text eol=lf

# Windows 脚本：CRLF 更符合惯例（powershell 两种都吃，但 CRLF 更稳）
*.ps1           text eol=crlf
*.psm1          text eol=crlf
*.bat           text eol=crlf
*.cmd           text eol=crlf

# 源码：归一化为 LF，检出按平台
*.go            text
*.py            text
*.js            text
*.jsx           text
*.mjs           text
*.cjs           text
*.ts            text
*.tsx           text
*.rs            text
*.kt            text
*.kts           text
*.css           text
*.html          text
*.json          text
*.yaml          text
*.yml           text
*.md            text
*.toml          text
*.xml           text

# 二进制：禁止任何行尾转换（否则会损坏文件）
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.ico           binary
*.webp          binary
*.mp3           binary
*.exe           binary
*.dll           binary
*.so            binary
*.apk           binary
*.jks           binary
*.sig           binary
*.bundle        binary
*.jar           binary

# 锁文件：保持原样，避免每次安装都产生 diff 噪声
Cargo.lock      text eol=lf
package-lock.json text eol=lf
